    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what if it's not just trauma? what if it's just the truth? some people are just born with something wrong in them, and i finally realized it. it feels so heavy... like i'm carrying this rot inside me that's just going to keep spreading to everyone i touch. i just want the noise to stop. i just want to stop being a burden to everyone. there's no \"processing\" this. some things are just irreparable.",
